// KitKat UI P16 Tier 1: the Android 4.4 SoundRecorder
// (com.android.soundrecorder) ported from android-4.4.4_r1. Donor UI and
// code verbatim; modernization limited to the hard-constraint layer:
//  - RECORD_AUDIO runtime-permission shim (SoundRecorder.onCreate).
//  - recordings written to the app external files dir (scoped storage)
//    and published via MediaStore, as in 4.4.
// Module keeps the name Recorder so vendor/lineage PRODUCT_PACKAGES
// (common_mobile_full.mk) resolves unchanged.
android_app {
    name: "Recorder",
    // Installs to the product partition like the app it replaces (the
    // lineage_sdk target enforces GSI artifact-path requirements on
    // /system - platform installs of these module names are rejected).
    product_specific: true,
    sdk_version: "current",
    srcs: ["src/**/*.java"],
    resource_dirs: ["res"],
}